  var iííììîí = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Krunker is a free-to-play first-person shooter game that offers a variety of game modes and weapons for you\n            to quickly play with your friends, anywhere, anytime.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">When you first open the game, you can simply click the main screen to start playing.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">The default mode is \"Free for All\", so shoot everyone you see!</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You have infinite bullets in Krunker. No need to worry about running out.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">The default weapon is the Assault Rifle.</span></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionBody svelte-los391\"><video style=\"width: 700px;\" preload=\"auto\"></video> <div class=\"tutorialSectionControls svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">These are the basic default controls (you can change them in settings):</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">W A S D - Movement</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Left Click - Shoot</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Right Click - Aim</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Space - Jump</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Shift - Crouch</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">1 2 3 - Killstreaks</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">E - Secondary Weapon</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Q - Melee Weapon</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">R - Reload</span></div></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionFooter svelte-los391\" style=\"margin-top: 20px;\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Once a match ends, you can vote on the next map and game mode.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">For additional information, please check out the other sections on this page.</span></div>", 3);
  var iiïîïií = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Playing with friends in Krunker is quick and easy.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Once you are in a game, click the \"Invite\" button in the matchmaking bar to copy a link to your game.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Send this link to your friends, and they can join you in the game by clicking the \"Join\" button.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"matchmakingBarImage svelte-los391\"></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Alternatively, you can also send them the link to your game by directly copying the URL from your browser's\n            address bar.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"inviteFriendsURLImage svelte-los391\"></div>", 1);
  var iïiïìîï = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Krunker features a lot of different classes, each with their own primary weapons, health and speed. Some\n            classes can even wall jump!</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can change classes by clicking your loadout information, next to your character preview.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Change class by clicking the one you want to play.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Once you select a class, you can modify your loadout.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can pick a secondary weapon, change attachments, reticles, charms and weapon skins.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: space-evenly;\"><img class=\"classAndLoadoutImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"classAndLoadoutImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"classAndLoadoutImage svelte-los391\"></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionFooter svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Note that you have to respawn for the changes to take effect.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Try each class and find out which one suits you best.</span></div>", 1);
  var iîííïiì = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">A lot of different types of cosmetics exist in Krunker. You can acquire cosmetics by using the spin wheels\n            in the shop.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can change your appearance by clicking \"Customize\" next to your character preview.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Equip a variety of items, like hats, silly faces, backpacks and more. You can even own a pet!</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can also change your character's skin and hair color.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: space-evenly;\"><img class=\"classAndLoadoutImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"classAndLoadoutImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"classAndLoadoutImage svelte-los391\"></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionFooter svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Your character preview will update accordingly, so you can visualize your new look.</span></div>", 1);
  var iîïiíìí = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Spin wheels are the primary way of earning cosmetics in Krunker.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">There are multiple spin wheels available in the shop, each with increasingly rare rewards and costs.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can spend currency to spin the wheels, or you can use \"Spin Tickets\" earned through the free and paid\n            tiers of the battlepass.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">The existing item rarities are \"Uncommon\", \"Rare\", \"Epic\", \"Legendary\", \"Relic\", \"Contraband\" and\n            \"Unobtainable\".</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"spinsImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"spinsImage svelte-los391\"></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionFooter svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Available items renew every season, so if you really want a specific item, you should try to get it before\n            the season ends.</span></div>", 1);
  var iiiìîíî = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Krunker as a lot of different game modes to offer.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">If you quickly want to move away from your current game mode, press the \"Quick Match\" button on the\n            matchmaking bar.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"matchmakingBarQuickMatchImage svelte-los391\"></div> <div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Alternatively, you can click \"Find Game\" to navigate the existing games list, or \"Host Game\" to make your\n            own.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"hostFindGameImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"hostGameSetupImage svelte-los391\"></div>", 1);
  var iìïíìií = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Challenges give players milestone goals to achieve. You can earn currency and special cosmetics by\n            completing them.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">There are challenges specific to each map and weapon.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"challengesImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"challengesImage svelte-los391\"></div>", 1);
  var iïìiîíí = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">In Krunker, \"Killstreaks\" are special abilities that you can use whenever you get a specific amount of kills\n            in a row.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">There are 3 available slots in your loadout, and multiple killstreaks for each slot, ranging from air drop\n            packages to nukes.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can change your assigned killstreaks in the loadout menu.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"challengesImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"challengesImage svelte-los391\"></div>", 1);
  var iïïîîîï = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">Play competitive ranked matches against other players.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">The game mode is 4v4 \"Hardpoint\", in a best of 3 format. Matches last around 10 to 15 minutes.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Play in a selected map pool tested and approved by the competitive Krunker community.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Climb through the ranks by winning matches, and earn special cosmetics at the end of each season.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">There is a leaderboard where you can see the rank of the top players in the world.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; gap: 20px; width: 100%; justify-content: center;\"><img class=\"rankedImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"rankedImage svelte-los391\"></div>", 1);
  var iîìíìîí = iíïïiiì("<div class=\"tutorialSectionIntro svelte-los391\"><span class=\"tutorialSectionHeader svelte-los391\">You and other players can group together to form a clan.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">You can apply to a clan or create your own through your player profile. You can only have one clan at a\n            time.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Clans have their own 4 letter tag, that will show up next to your name.</span> <span class=\"tutorialSectionText svelte-los391\">Once a clan is created, the clan commander can manage the clan through the clan page.</span></div> <div style=\"display: flex; width: 100%; gap: 20px; justify-content: space-evenly;\"><div style=\"display: flex; width: 40%; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px;\"><img class=\"clanCreateImage svelte-los391\"> <img class=\"clanCreateImage svelte-los391\"></div> <img class=\"clanManageImage svelte-los391\"></div>", 1);
